# A SOLICIT whose IA_NA has 8 octets of value where it needs at least 12 (IAID, T1, T2): the
# walk of the options is well formed, the typed option is not.
#
# msg-type SOLICIT, transaction id 0x0badc0
01 0b ad c0
# option 1, client identifier, 10 octets: DUID-LL, hardware type 1, the MAC
00 01 00 0a
00 03 00 01 00 00 5e 00 53 01
# option 3, IA_NA, 8 octets: IAID and T1 only
00 03 00 08
5e 00 53 01
00 00 00 00
